{
    "title": "PC keyboard arrows",
    "rules": [
        {
            "description": "Ctrl+Left/Right moves by word, Win+Left/Right switches Spaces, Win+Shift+Left/Right moves the window a Space, Alt+Left/Right moves by word too (PC muscle memory, alongside the setup-macos modifier rotation)",
